          "jcr:created": "Thu Feb 06 2025 18:52:38 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>Adherus AutoSpray and Adherus AutoSpray ET Dural Sealants are indicated for use in patients who are 13 years of age and older, as an adjunct to standard methods of dural repair, such as sutures, to provide watertight closure<sup>4</sup> during cranial procedures.</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon May 19 2025 14:31:49 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
        "curatedcta": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-73104d59b2@example.invalid",
