          "jcr:created": "Fri Feb 14 2025 15:03:49 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Adherus AutoSpray &amp;&nbsp;Adherus AutoSpray ET</span></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon May 19 2025 14:28:18 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
        "text_1963332598_copy_1478592483": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-73104d59b2@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-73104d59b2@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Feb 14 2025 15:06:12 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Features and benefits:</span></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Feb 14 2025 15:06:24 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-73104d59b2@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-73104d59b2@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Feb 14 2025 15:07:11 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<ul>\n<li>Maintains burst pressure strength above physiological intracranial pressure in an in vitro model<sup>2</sup></li>\n<li>Absorbs over approximately 90 days<sup>3</sup></li>\n<li>Extended tip applicator</li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri May 16 2025 15:56:03 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
    "section_title_2075094438": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "user-73104d59b2@example.invalid",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-73104d59b2@example.invalid",
      "hideSectionTitleComp": "true",
      "deepLinkingId": "contraindications",
      "jcr:created": "Fri Feb 14 2025 21:00:36 GMT+0000",
      "title": "Contraindications",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Feb 14 2025 21:00:52 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/section-title"
    },
    "text": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "user-73104d59b2@example.invalid",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-73104d59b2@example.invalid",
      "jcr:created": "Fri Feb 14 2025 15:08:21 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Contraindications:</span></span></p>\n<p>Adherus AutoSpray and Adherus AutoSpray ET Dural Sealant should not be used in confined anatomical spaces where nerve compression is of concern. The hydrogel may swell by up to 13% of its size in any dimension or 46% by volume after application.</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Feb 14 2025 21:45:52 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
    "section_title_305290747": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "user-73104d59b2@example.invalid",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-73104d59b2@example.invalid",
      "hideSectionTitleComp": "true",
      "deepLinkingId": "pivotal-trial-results",
      "jcr:created": "Fri Feb 14 2025 15:13:54 GMT+0000",
      "title": "Pivotal trial results",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Feb 14 2025 21:44:28 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/section-title"
    },
    "text_copy_199229330": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "user-73104d59b2@example.invalid",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-73104d59b2@example.invalid",
      "jcr:created": "Fri Feb 14 2025 15:08:21 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Pivotal trial results:</span></span></p>\n<p>A prospective, randomized, controlled, multicenter pivotal trial was conducted to evaluate the safety and effectiveness of Adherus AutoSpray Dural Sealant. The primary endpoint of this study was a composite evaluation of the safety and effectiveness of Adherus AutoSpray Dural Sealant (n=124 subjects) when compared to an active control (n=126 subjects). The endpoint results were based on the number of subjects who were free from intra-operative CSF leakage from dural repair after up to two applications of sealant during the Valsalva maneuver, CSF leak/pseudomeningocele during the 120-day follow-up period and unplanned retreatment of the original surgical site within 120 days post-surgery. The overall success rate for the complete case analysis was 91.2% in the Adherus group compared to 90.6% in the control group. Adherus was found to be non-inferior to the control with the non-inferiority margin of 10% (p = 0.005). In the early post-surgical period when the sealants are expected to function, the overall success rate at the 14-day follow-up on subjects who completed the visit was 99.1% in the Adherus group compared to 95.0% in the control group. In addition, the overall success rate at the 45-day follow-up on subjects who completed the visit was 96.6% in the Adherus group compared to 91.9% in the control group. There were no unanticipated adverse device effects. Among the subjects treated with Adherus AutoSpray Dural Sealant, there were no device related deep wound infections and no cases of meningitis. The type and rate of adverse events observed in this study are consistent with the complexity of the surgical procedure and the co-morbid condition of the treated subjects.<sup>1</sup></p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Feb 14 2025 21:45:40 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
